# Context allowlist for apps/nextcloud/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore for a repo-root context): what `rush install`
# reads — rush.json, the Rush config + lockfile, EVERY project's package.json —
# plus the sources the image builds: the web shell and its libs, the relay,
# this package, the Help pages (docs/guide) and the example themes the shell
# bundles (examples/themes, read by vite.config.ts and theme-examples.ts).
# Keeps out node_modules, build outputs, common/temp and .git.
*
!rush.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!common/config/rush/
!common/scripts/
!apps/*/package.json
!apps/web/
!apps/relay/
!apps/nextcloud/
!libs/
!docs/guide/
!examples/themes/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-*
**/.svelte-kit
apps/web/e2e/
apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/playwright-report/
apps/web/public/guide/
apps/relay/data/
